  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br />A normal vector perpendicular to the plane <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br />A normal vector perpendicular to the plane <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> is <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br />A vector parallel to the line of intersection is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></math> be the acute angle between them then,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>e</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
